# Following Pokémon (docs/decisions.md; world party-follower.ts): the rules. The lead that follows is the
# first party Pokémon that is not fainted and not an egg (Chimchar here, a Platinum walking set). In
# Sandgem Town it waits under the player after the warp; the Bicycle (registered, on Y) recalls it; getting
# off puts it back under the player until the next step; walking into the Pokémon Center (indoors: height
# restricted, a small set follows) recreates it under the player, and a save and load keeps it there.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 20
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 5
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_CHIMCHAR 10
set state party[0].hp 0
set state party[1].isEgg true
give item platinum:ITEM_BICYCLE 1
set state registeredItem "platinum:ITEM_BICYCLE"
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN 177 847 up
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":177,"z":847,"facing":"up","waiting":true}
# Y gets on the bike: recalled while cycling
+1 press y
+1 release y
until state playerState "cycle"
+1 assert state partyFollower null
+0 press up
until position 177 845
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower null
# Y gets off: under the player, out on the tile they leave
+1 press y
+1 release y
until state playerState "walk"
+1 assert state partyFollower {"x":177,"z":845,"facing":"up","waiting":true}
+0 press up
until position 177 844
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":177,"z":845,"facing":"up","waiting":false}
# The door: the map load recreates it under the player
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN_POKECENTER_1F"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":8,"z":12,"facing":"up","waiting":true}
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":8,"z":12,"facing":"up","waiting":true}
+0 press up
until position 8 11
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state partyFollower {"x":8,"z":12,"facing":"up","waiting":false}
